     "content": "\u010a\u010aFINALACTIONS:\u0120open(l)\u0120pick(o)\u0120place(o,\u0120inside_grill)\u0120close(l)\u0120open(l)\u0120pick(o)\u0120place(o,\u0120plate_top)",
